<title>USA: Entergy Corp has 73 pct London Electricity.</title>
<headline>Entergy Corp has 73 pct London Electricity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Entergy Corp said on Friday its offer to buy London Electricity Plc was successful, with 73 percent of London's shares now tendered.</p>
<p>Entergy's recommended cash offer of $2.1 billion has been declared wholly unconditional.  The offer remains open for further acceptances.</p>
</text>
